@startuml postgres-dynamic-query-sequence
' Dynamic view (sequence) — KHÔNG phải C4 Level 4 (Code).
' Mô tả Simple Query path sau khi backend session đã tồn tại.

title PostgreSQL — Path of a Query (sequence)\n(sau khi connect; backend đã được fork)

actor "Client\n(psql + libpq)" as Client
participant "Backend\nprotocol I/O" as BeProto
participant "tcop" as Tcop
participant "Parser" as Parser
participant "Rewriter" as Rewrite
participant "Planner" as Opt
participant "Executor" as Exec
participant "Access +\nStorage" as Store

== Session đã có (postmaster đã fork backend) ==

Client -> BeProto : Query message\n(SQL text)
BeProto -> Tcop : exec_simple_query()
Tcop -> Parser : parse + analyze
Parser --> Tcop : Query tree
Tcop -> Rewrite : rewrite (views/rules)
Rewrite --> Tcop : rewritten Query
Tcop -> Opt : planner()
Opt --> Tcop : Plan tree
Tcop -> Exec : ExecutorRun()
Exec -> Store : lấy / sửa pages & tuples
Store --> Exec : tuples
Exec --> Tcop : result
Tcop --> BeProto : RowDescription / DataRow / …
BeProto --> Client : result set

note right of Opt
  Source gợi ý:
  backend/libpq (protocol server)
  tcop/postgres.c
  parser/
  rewrite/
  optimizer/plan/planner.c
  executor/execMain.c
  access/ + storage/
end note

note left of Client
  Bước connect (không vẽ ở đây):
  Client → postmaster → fork backend
  rồi mới tới sequence này.
end note

@enduml
